                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>When should I hire my first specialist?</h3>
                                        <p>Typically at ₹15-30 lakh MRR. First specialists: performance marketing + creator manager + designer. Wait until founder can effectively manage specialists.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest D2C hiring mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Over-hiring pre-PMF. Team costs outrun revenue. Wait for unit economics + revenue trajectory to prove out.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I hire CMO early?</h3>
                                        <p>Rarely — most brands don't need CMO until ₹3-6 Cr ARR. Marketing lead + specialist hires usually sufficient until then.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should I spend on team?</h3>
                                        <p>Rough guideline: total salary 15-25% of revenue at growth-stage. Below 12% suggests under-investment; above 30% suggests unsustainable overhead.</p>
